{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46918","headline":"送谢尊师自南岳出入京 · 齐己","name":"送谢尊师自南岳出入京","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"曾听鹿鸣逢世乱，因披羽服隐衡阳。\n几多事隔丹霄兴，三十年成两鬓霜。\n芝术未甘销勇气，风骚无那激刚肠。\n中朝旧有知音在，可是悠悠入帝乡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46918.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46918","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}